@startuml holub-life-object
' Holub Life Game (HolubLife.jar v1.02) - 객체 다이어그램 (런타임 스냅샷)
' 시점: 프로그램 시작 직후, 사용자가 중앙 블록 inner[3][3] 안에 Blinker(가로 3칸)를 클릭해 놓은 상태, 아직 tick 전
' 근거: Universe 생성자, Neighborhood(int, Cell)/create(), Clock.instance(), Publisher.subscribe()

skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK KR"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam object {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #444444
  ArrowColor #444444
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBE6
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

title Holub Life Game — 객체 다이어그램\n(Blinker 3칸을 클릭한 직후, tick 전 스냅샷)

' ===== 진입 / 싱글톤 =====
object "frame : Life" as frame {
  title = "The Game of Life. (c)2003 ..."
}

object "theInstance : Universe" as universe #EAF2FF {
  outermostCell = outer
  (JPanel, 크기 64×8 = 512px)
}

object "instance : Clock" as clock #EAF2FF {
  clock = Timer
  tick = null  (정지 상태)
  publisher = pub
}

object "pub : Publisher" as pub {
  subscribers = node1
}

object "node1 : Publisher.Node" as node1 {
  subscriber = listener
  next = null
}

object "listener : Universe$익명\n(Clock.Listener)" as listener {
  (Universe.this 참조)
}

' ===== Composite 계층 =====
object "outer : Neighborhood" as outer #FFF4E0 {
  gridSize = 8
  grid = Cell[8][8]
  amActive = true
  activeEdges = NONE
  oneLastRefreshRequired = false
}

object "inner[0][0] : Neighborhood" as in00 {
  gridSize = 8
  amActive = false
  activeEdges = NONE
}

object "inner[3][3] : Neighborhood" as in33 #FFF4E0 {
  gridSize = 8
  amActive = true
  activeEdges = NONE
  (내부 칸만 바뀌어 경계 비활성)
}

object "inner[7][7] : Neighborhood" as in77 {
  gridSize = 8
  amActive = false
  activeEdges = NONE
}

object "… 나머지 61개\ninner : Neighborhood" as inRest #F2F2F2 {
}

object "r[0][0] : Resident" as r00 {
  amAlive = false
  willBeAlive = false
}

object "… 63개 : Resident" as r00rest #F2F2F2 {
}

object "r[3][2] : Resident" as r32 #FFE0E0 {
  amAlive = true
  willBeAlive = false
}

object "r[3][3] : Resident" as r33 #FFE0E0 {
  amAlive = true
  willBeAlive = false
}

object "r[3][4] : Resident" as r34 #FFE0E0 {
  amAlive = true
  willBeAlive = false
}

object "… 61개 : Resident" as r33rest #F2F2F2 {
  amAlive = false
}

' ===== 공유 객체 (static) =====
object "readingPermitted : ConditionVariable" as cv {
  isTrue = true
  (Neighborhood의 static 필드 —
   65개 Neighborhood가 공유)
}

object "DUMMY : Cell$익명" as dummy {
  isAlive() = false 고정
  (바깥 경계 이웃으로 인자 전달만 됨)
}

object "NONE : Direction.Immutable" as dnone {
  map = 0x00
}

' ===== 링크 =====
frame --> universe : getContentPane().add()
universe --> outer : outermostCell
clock --> pub : publisher
pub --> node1 : subscribers
node1 --> listener : subscriber
listener ..> universe : outer this

outer *-- in00 : grid[0][0]
outer *-- in33 : grid[3][3]
outer *-- in77 : grid[7][7]
outer *-- inRest

in00 *-- r00 : grid[0][0]
in00 *-- r00rest
in33 *-- r32 : grid[3][2]
in33 *-- r33 : grid[3][3]
in33 *-- r34 : grid[3][4]
in33 *-- r33rest

outer ..> cv
in33 ..> cv
listener ..> dummy : figureNextState(DUMMY×8)
dummy ..> dnone : isDisruptiveTo()

note right of outer
  <b>총 객체 수</b>
  Neighborhood 1 + 64 = 65개
  Resident 64 × 64 = 4,096개
  → 화면은 64×64 칸
end note

note bottom of r33rest
  절대 좌표로 보면 Blinker는
  (27,26) (27,27) (27,28) 위치.
  inner[3][3]이 행·열 24~31을 담당
end note

note as Proto
  <b>Prototype으로 생성 후 버려지는 객체</b>
  Universe 생성자에서
  ① new Resident() → 안쪽 Neighborhood의 prototype
  ② new Neighborhood(8, ①) → 바깥 Neighborhood의 prototype
     (자기 grid를 위해 Resident 64개를 또 생성)
  두 prototype은 어디에도 저장되지 않아 곧바로 GC 대상.
  실제 grid는 prototype.create()로 만든 복제본으로 채워짐
  (Neighborhood.create() = new Neighborhood(gridSize, grid[0][0]))
end note

Proto .. universe

@enduml
